0.59%，收于3634.35点。深证成指下跌2.05%。超过4700只股票下跌。"], "body": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35. The Shenzhen index lost 2.05 percent. More than 4,700 stocks went down.\n\nNvidia said Jensen Huang will leave his job as CEO. Nvidia shares fell. Chinese electronics stocks fell too, and some hit their daily limit.\n\nSome robot stocks also hit their limit. Xiangyang Bearing had risen for eight days. Daye shares fell after a weak profit report.\n\nThese stocks still cost much more than their business value. Investors should wait for real orders and better profit.\n\nThe Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35.", "body_zh": "上证指数下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点。深证成指下跌2.05%。超过4700只股票下跌。\n\n英伟达宣布黄仁勋将辞去首席执行官一职。英伟达股价下跌。中国电子类股票也下跌，部分股票跌停。\n\n一些机器人概念股也跌停。襄阳轴承此前连续八个交易日上涨。大业股份在业绩疲软的报告后下跌。\n\n这些股票的股价仍远高于其业务价值。投资者应等待真实订单和更好的利润。\n\n上证指数下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点。深证成指下跌2.05%。超过4700只股票下跌。", "text": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35. The Shenzhen index lost 2.05 percent. More than 4,700 stocks went down. Nvidia said Jensen Huang will leave his job as CEO. Nvidia shares fell. Chinese electronics stocks fell too, and some hit their daily limit. Some robot stocks also hit their limit. Xiangyang Bearing had risen for eight days. Daye shares fell after a weak profit report. These stocks still cost much more than their business value. Investors should wait for real orders and better profit. The Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35.", "vocab": [{"word": "stock", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票", "note": "常用复数 stocks 表示股市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fall", "pos": "verb", "zh": "下跌", "note": "过去式 fell", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "index", "pos": "noun", "zh": "指数", "note": "如 Shanghai index 上证指数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "公司股票", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "CEO", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首席执行官", "note": "公司最高负责人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "limit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "限制；跌停板", "note": "hit the limit